{"ref":"BDB, לוּן²","hw":"לוּן²","html":"† II. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">לוּן</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. murmur</strong>, only <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15\" href=\"/Exodus.15\">Ex 15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16\" href=\"/Exodus.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17\" href=\"/Exodus.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14\" href=\"/Numbers.14\">Nu 14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16\" href=\"/Numbers.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17\" href=\"/Numbers.17\">17</a>, and <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:18\" href=\"/Joshua.9.18\">Jos 9:18</a> <strong>(</strong>Sam. always defect., hence Nö<sup>ZMG xxxvii, 1883, 535 n.</sup> thinks poss. <span dir=\"rtl\">לנן</span> [cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, רָנַן\" href=\"/BDB,_רָנַן\", dir=\"rtl\">רנן</a>?]; from limited occurrence, he supposes it disappeared early; but found chiefly in P<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Niph.</strong>  Impf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּלּוֹ֫נוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:24\" href=\"/Exodus.15.24\">Ex 15:24</a> + 3 times + <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:2\" href=\"/Exodus.16.2\">Ex 16:2</a> Qr (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">וילינו</span>) + <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:36\" href=\"/Numbers.14.36\">Nu 14:36</a> Kt (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּלִּי֫נוּ</span>, <strong>Hiph.</strong>); 2 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּלּוֹ֫נוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:7\" href=\"/Exodus.16.7\">Ex 16:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:11\" href=\"/Numbers.16.11\">Nu 16:11</a>, both Kt (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּלִּי֫נוּ</span>); on forms v. Ges<sup>§ 72 ee</sup> Kö<sup>i. 509</sup>;—<em>murmur</em> against, sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:24\" href=\"/Exodus.15.24\">Ex 15:24</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:2\" href=\"/Exodus.16.2\">16:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:7\" href=\"/Exodus.16.7\">7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:2\" href=\"/Numbers.14.2\">Nu 14:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:11\" href=\"/Numbers.16.11\">16:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:6\" href=\"/Numbers.17.6\">17:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:18\" href=\"/Joshua.9.18\">Jos 9:18</a> (all P; all of people Isr.); abs. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 59:16\" href=\"/Psalms.59.16\">ψ 59:16</a> (v. <span dir=\"rtl\">׃לון</span> <strong>1 a</strong>).<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  Pf. 2 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲלִינֹתֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:29\" href=\"/Numbers.14.29\">Nu 14:29</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּ֫לָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:3\" href=\"/Exodus.17.3\">Ex 17:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּלִּי֫נוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:2\" href=\"/Exodus.16.2\">Ex 16:2</a> Kt, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:36\" href=\"/Numbers.14.36\">Nu 14:36</a> Qr; 2 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּלִּי֫נוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:7\" href=\"/Exodus.16.7\">Ex 16:7</a> Qr, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:11\" href=\"/Numbers.16.11\">Nu 16:11</a> Qr (on all vid. supr.); Pt. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלִּינִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:8\" href=\"/Exodus.16.8\">Ex 16:8</a> + 3 times;—<em>murmur</em> = Niph., sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:3\" href=\"/Exodus.17.3\">Ex 17:3</a> (E), elsewhere P: <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:8\" href=\"/Exodus.16.8\">16:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:27\" href=\"/Numbers.14.27\">Nu 14:27</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:29\" href=\"/Numbers.14.29\">29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:20\" href=\"/Numbers.17.20\">17:20</a>; <em>cause to murmur</em>, sq. acc. + <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:36\" href=\"/Numbers.14.36\">Nu 14:36</a> Qr; (cf. also supra <strong>Niph.</strong>)","next":"BDB, תְּלֻנָּה","prev":"BDB, מְלוּנָה"}